            "explanation": "(a) 63/140: 63 = 3² × 7, 140 = 2² × 5 × 7, common factor 7: 63/140 = 9/20. 20 = 2² × 5, terminating: 9/20 = 45/100 = 0.45 kg. (b) 55/132: 55 = 5 × 11, 132 = 2² × 3 × 11, common factor 11: 55/132 = 5/12. 12 = 2² × 3, 3 hai, so recurring: 5/12 = 0.41 6 6 6... = 0.4166... kg (kabhi exact not). To (a) in exact decimal. Verification: 0.45 × 140 = 63 ✅ and 5/12 × 132 = 55 ✅"
