            "headingHinglish": "Class 9 se yaad",
            "body": "Class 9 mein tum teen kaam seekh chuke ho. Pehla, **zero** wo number a hai jiske liye p(a) = 0 (aur degree n ke polynomial ke zyada se zyada n zero hote hain): [polynomials-part5.md](../../../class9/maths/polynomials/polynomials-part5.md). Doosra, **factor theorem**: p(a) = 0 tabhi jab (x − a) p(x) ka factor ho: [polynomials-part6.md](../../../class9/maths/polynomials/polynomials-part6.md). Teesra, quadratic ko **middle term todkar factorise** karna: [factorisation-part5.md](../../../class9/maths/factorisation/factorisation-part5.md). Tab hum hamesha pehle factorise karte the, tab zero milte the. Aaj ka sawaal ulta hai: **zero nikaale bina kya pata chal sakta hai?**",
            "bodyHinglish": "Class 9 mein tum teen kaam seekh chuke ho. Pehla, **zero** wo number a hai jiske liye p(a) = 0 (aur degree n ke polynomial ke zyada se zyada n zero hote hain): [polynomials-part5.md](../../../class9/maths/polynomials/polynomials-part5.md). Doosra, **factor theorem**: p(a) = 0 tabhi jab (x − a) p(x) ka factor ho: [polynomials-part6.md](../../../class9/maths/polynomials/polynomials-part6.md). Teesra, quadratic ko **middle term todkar factorise** karna: [factorisation-part5.md](../../../class9/maths/factorisation/factorisation-part5.md). Tab hum hamesha pehle factorise karte the, tab zero milte the. Aaj ka sawaal ulta hai: **zero nikaale bina kya pata chal sakta hai?**"
