            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Parchi (diagnosis slip)** | Hal shuru karne se pehle ke chaar sawaalon ke chhote jawab: kya diya hai, kya poochha hai, kis type ki hai, to kaunsa pehla kadam | Part A ki table aur Part B ki teeno parchiyan |\n| **Ulta udaharan** | Ek sachcha example jo kisi daave ko jhootha saabit kar de. Ek ulta udaharan kaafi hai, jabki daave ko sahi saabit karne ke liye poori daleel chahiye | x = 43 rakhne par (x − 7)(x + 9) = 1872 aata hai, 36 nahi: Galti 1 |\n| **Doctor ka routine** | Har sawaal par chaar kadam: Pehchano, Chuno, Hal karo, Jaancho | Figure 7.1 |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Parchi (diagnosis slip)** | Hal shuru karne se pehle ke chaar sawaalon ke chhote jawab: kya diya hai, kya poochha hai, kis type ki hai, to kaunsa pehla kadam | Part A ki table aur Part B ki teeno parchiyan |\n| **Ulta udaharan** | Ek sachcha example jo kisi daave ko jhootha saabit kar de. Ek ulta udaharan kaafi hai, jabki daave ko sahi saabit karne ke liye poori daleel chahiye | x = 43 rakhne par (x − 7)(x + 9) = 1872 aata hai, 36 nahi: Galti 1 |\n| **Doctor ka routine** | Har sawaal par chaar kadam: Pehchano, Chuno, Hal karo, Jaancho | Figure 7.1 |"
