            "bodyHinglish": "| Topic | Kya mila | Is topic mein kahan kaam aayega |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Topic 1](quadratic-equations.md) | Standard form, root = zero, factorisation aur zero-product property | Part B (factors wali parchi), Galti 1 |\n| [Topic 2](quadratic-equations-part2.md) | Fraction wali equation: excluded values, denominator hatana, bahari root | Part C (dhaara wali kahani) |\n| [Topic 3](quadratic-equations-part3.md) | Completing the square: (aadha coefficient)² dono taraf | Part C ka proof wala example |\n| [Topic 4](quadratic-equations-part4.md) | Formula x = (−b ± √(b² − 4ac)) / (2a) aur jod-guna ki Jaanch | Part B, C, D |\n| [Topic 5](quadratic-equations-part5.md) | Discriminant D = b² − 4ac aur uske teen haalat | Part B (teesri parchi), Part C |\n| [Topic 6](quadratic-equations-part6.md) | Kahani se equation banana, story check | Part C (story check) |\n\nChapter 2 ([polynomials-part2.md](../polynomials/polynomials-part2.md)) ka rishta bhi saath rahega: roots ka **jod −b/a** aur **guna c/a**. Parabola aur x-axis ki tasveer [polynomials.md](../polynomials/polynomials.md) mein hai, aur Galti 2 mein kaam aayegi."
