            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 2 ka formula **aₙ = a + (n − 1)d** hamara auzaar hai ([arithmetic-progressions-part2.md](arithmetic-progressions-part2.md)). Iska \"kyun\" yaad rakho: a₁ se aₙ tak pahunchne ke liye d ko n − 1 baar jodna padta hai. Isi baat se is topic ki saari paheliyan khulengi: bas ye dekhna hai ki do terms ke beech kitne \"qadam\" hain."
