            "body": "Mukul chhutti mein Nana ke gaon gaya. Gaon ke chhote talaab (lagbhag 4,500 m² ka) mein ek jalkumbhi (water hyacinth) ka patch tairta tha. Nana ne kaha, \"Beta, aaj iska area 7 m² hai. Ye paudha bahut tez phailta hai: **har hafte apne area ka teen guna** ho jaata hai.\" (Asli paudhe hamesha itni saaf raftaar se nahi badhte, par kahani ke liye maan lete hain.)\n\nMukul ne copy mein likha:\n\nHafta 1: 7 m². Hafta 2: 7 × 3 = 21 m². Hafta 3: 21 × 3 = 63 m². Hafta 4: 63 × 3 = 189 m².\n\nNana muskuraaye, \"Ab bata, **10ven hafte** mein kitna area hoga?\" Mukul ne ginti ki: chhe aur baar guna karna padega... aur agar Nana poochhein ki 40ven hafte mein? 39 baar guna! Mukul ne copy band kar di, \"Nana, koi shortcut hai kya?\"\n\nHai, aur wo shortcut Topic 1 mein hi chhupa tha: **a, ar, ar², ar³, ...** ko dhyan se dekho, power hamesha position se **ek kam** hai. Wahi aaj ka formula hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mukul chhutti mein Nana ke gaon gaya. Gaon ke chhote talaab (lagbhag 4,500 m² ka) mein ek jalkumbhi (water hyacinth) ka patch tairta tha. Nana ne kaha, \"Beta, aaj iska area 7 m² hai. Ye paudha bahut tez phailta hai: **har hafte apne area ka teen guna** ho jaata hai.\" (Asli paudhe hamesha itni saaf raftaar se nahi badhte, par kahani ke liye maan lete hain.)\n\nMukul ne copy mein likha:\n\nHafta 1: 7 m². Hafta 2: 7 × 3 = 21 m². Hafta 3: 21 × 3 = 63 m². Hafta 4: 63 × 3 = 189 m².\n\nNana muskuraaye, \"Ab bata, **10ven hafte** mein kitna area hoga?\" Mukul ne ginti ki: chhe aur baar guna karna padega... aur agar Nana poochhein ki 40ven hafte mein? 39 baar guna! Mukul ne copy band kar di, \"Nana, koi shortcut hai kya?\"\n\nHai, aur wo shortcut Topic 1 mein hi chhupa tha: **a, ar, ar², ar³, ...** ko dhyan se dekho, power hamesha position se **ek kam** hai. Wahi aaj ka formula hai."
