            "bodyHinglish": "| Kahan | Kya mila | Is topic mein kahan kaam aayega |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Topic 2](geometric-progressions-part2.md) | aₙ = a rⁿ⁻¹: pehle term ko r se (n − 1) baar guna karna | Part A: do terms ka ratio |\n| [Class 9, Number Systems Topic 6](../../../class9/maths/number-systems/number-systems-part6.md) | aᵐ ÷ aⁿ = aᵐ⁻ⁿ | Part A: rᵐ ÷ rᵏ = rᵐ⁻ᵏ |\n| [Chapter 4, Topic 3](../arithmetic-progressions/arithmetic-progressions-part3.md) | Arithmetic mean (AM) = (a + c)/2, AP ka beech ka term | Part F: AM aur GM ka comparison |\n| [Quadratic equations, Topic 4](../quadratic-equations/quadratic-equations-part4.md) | Quadratic formula aur D = b² − 4ac | Part E, G, H: x ya r ki quadratic |\n| [Quadratic equations, Topic 6](../quadratic-equations/quadratic-equations-part6.md) | Story check: jawab kahani mein baith raha hai ya nahi | Part B, E, G: jawab ki jaanch |"
