            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Barabar-hal inequations (equivalent inequations)** | Wo inequations jinka solution set ek hi hota hai. Har sahi kadam ek barabar-hal inequation deta hai | 4x + 9 > 33, 4x > 24 aur x > 6 teeno barabar-hal hain |\n| **Sign ulatna (reversal)** | Dono taraf ko **negative number** se guna ya bhaag karne par inequation ke sign ko palat dena: < ban jaata hai >, ≤ ban jaata hai ≥, aur ulta | −3x < 12 ko −3 se divide karo: x > −4 |\n| **Transposition (paksh badalna)** | Kisi term ko = ki jagah inequation ke sign ke doosri taraf le jaana, aur uska sign (+ ya −) badal dena. Ye asal mein dono taraf wahi number jodna ya ghataana hai | x + 7 < 10 mein +7 ko doosri taraf bhejo: x < 10 − 7 |\n| **Positive LCM se guna** | Fraction hatane ke liye saare denominators ke LCM se dono taraf guna karna. LCM positive hota hai, to **sign nahi badalta** | (2x − 3)/4 < 5/2 ko 4 se guna karo |"
