            "body": "- **Number families** ([number-systems.md](../../../class9/maths/number-systems/number-systems.md)): N = {1, 2, 3, ...}, W = {0, 1, 2, ...}, Z = {..., −2, −1, 0, 1, 2, ...}. R mein in sab ke beech ke decimal aur fractions bhi aate hain.\n- **Number line** ([number-systems.md](../../../class9/maths/number-systems/number-systems.md), Part D): har number ki line par ek pakki jagah hoti hai, right ki taraf number **bada**, left ki taraf **chhota** (isliye −3 < −1). [number-systems-part3.md](../../../class9/maths/number-systems/number-systems-part3.md) ke Part D mein √2 ko bhi apni jagah mili thi. Yahi jagah ab solution set ke liye kaam aayegi.\n- **Topic 1 aur 2** (is chapter ke): replacement set aur solution set, aur hal karne ke niyam, jinse hum seedhe x ≥ 5 jaise bayan tak pahunchenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Number families** ([number-systems.md](../../../class9/maths/number-systems/number-systems.md)): N = {1, 2, 3, ...}, W = {0, 1, 2, ...}, Z = {..., −2, −1, 0, 1, 2, ...}. R mein in sab ke beech ke decimal aur fractions bhi aate hain.\n- **Number line** ([number-systems.md](../../../class9/maths/number-systems/number-systems.md), Part D): har number ki line par ek pakki jagah hoti hai, right ki taraf number **bada**, left ki taraf **chhota** (isliye −3 < −1). [number-systems-part3.md](../../../class9/maths/number-systems/number-systems-part3.md) ke Part D mein √2 ko bhi apni jagah mili thi. Yahi jagah ab solution set ke liye kaam aayegi.\n- **Topic 1 aur 2** (is chapter ke): replacement set aur solution set, aur hal karne ke niyam, jinse hum seedhe x ≥ 5 jaise bayan tak pahunchenge."
