            "bodyHinglish": "Vasant aur Papa Dadi ko train mein bithane station gaye. Dadi ki train 6:30 par thi. Gate ke board par likha tha (ye is kahani ka apna niyam hai, kisi asli station ka nahi): \"Platform gate train se 45 minute pehle khulega aur 10 minute pehle band ho jaayega.\"\n\nVasant ne ghadi dekhi aur socha: \"Gate 5:45 par khulta hai aur 6:20 par band. To hume 5:45 se pehle andar nahi jaane denge, aur 6:20 ke baad bhi nahi.\" Yaani ek hi samay par **do shartein** ek saath sach honi chahiye: 5:45 se **pehle nahi**, aur 6:20 se **baad nahi**.\n\nPapa ne kaha: \"Ghar se station 25 minute ka raasta hai. Bata, hume ghar se kab nikalna chahiye?\" Vasant ne 5:00 ko \"0\" maana aur socha: agar hum x minute baad (5:00 ke x minute baad) nikle, to station x + 25 par pahunchenge. To:\n\n**45 ≤ x + 25 ≤ 80**\n\nEk hi line mein do inequations! Pehle ye \"double\" wali shakl samajhte hain, phir Vasant ka sawaal hal karenge."
