            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Double inequation** | Do inequations ko ek hi line mein jodna, jisme beech mein ek expression ho aur dono taraf ek-ek hadd: a < expression ≤ b. Matlab expression a se bada **aur** b se chhota ya barabar | −8 ≤ 5 − 3x < 14 |\n| **Intersection (∩)** | Do solution sets ka **common hissa**: wo members jo dono mein hon. \"Aur\" wali shart ka solution set | {1, 2, 3} ∩ {2, 3, 4} = {2, 3} |\n| **Union (∪)** | Do solution sets ko **milakar** ek set: wo members jo kam se kam ek mein hon. \"Ya\" wali shart ka solution set | {1, 2, 3} ∪ {2, 3, 4} = {1, 2, 3, 4} |\n| **Khaali set (∅ ya { })** | Aisa set jisme koi member nahi hota. Jab koi bhi value shart poori na kare | x > 6 aur x < 4 ka solution set |\n| **Hamesha sach** | Aisi inequation jo replacement set ki **har** value par sach ho, to solution set poora replacement set hota hai | 2x + 5 ≤ 2(x + 3) |"
