            "body": "| Kya chahiye | Kahan seekha | Is topic mein kaise kaam aayega |\n|---|---|---|\n| Replacement set aur solution set | [linear-inequations.md](linear-inequations.md) (Topic 1) | Har example mein replacement set (R, Z, W ya N) pehle likhenge |\n| Sign ulatne ka niyam | [linear-inequations-part2.md](linear-inequations-part2.md) (Topic 2) | Teeno hisson par negative se divide karte waqt |\n| Open aur filled circle, shading | [linear-inequations-part3.md](linear-inequations-part3.md) (Topic 3) | Do shartein ek number line par aur unka overlap |\n\nClass 9 se sets: **N = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, ...}**, **W = {0, 1, 2, 3, 4, ...}**, **Z = {..., −3, −2, −1, 0, 1, 2, 3, ...}**.\n\nNiyam jo hum baar-baar use karenge: **multiply or divide both sides by a negative number ⇒ reverse the sign (< becomes >, ≤ becomes ≥)**. Positive number se guna ya bhaag karne par sign nahi badalta, aur jodne-ghatane par bhi nahi.",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Kya chahiye | Kahan seekha | Is topic mein kaise kaam aayega |\n|---|---|---|\n| Replacement set aur solution set | [linear-inequations.md](linear-inequations.md) (Topic 1) | Har example mein replacement set (R, Z, W ya N) pehle likhenge |\n| Sign ulatne ka niyam | [linear-inequations-part2.md](linear-inequations-part2.md) (Topic 2) | Teeno hisson par negative se divide karte waqt |\n| Open aur filled circle, shading | [linear-inequations-part3.md](linear-inequations-part3.md) (Topic 3) | Do shartein ek number line par aur unka overlap |\n\nClass 9 se sets: **N = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, ...}**, **W = {0, 1, 2, 3, 4, ...}**, **Z = {..., −3, −2, −1, 0, 1, 2, 3, ...}**.\n\nNiyam jo hum baar-baar use karenge: **multiply or divide both sides by a negative number ⇒ reverse the sign (< becomes >, ≤ becomes ≥)**. Positive number se guna ya bhaag karne par sign nahi badalta, aur jodne-ghatane par bhi nahi."
