            "body": "Topic 1 se Topic 4 tak tumhare paas inequation ke poore auzaar jama ho gaye: limit ki bhasha aur replacement set (Topic 1), hal karna aur negative se divide karte waqt sign ulatna (Topic 2), solution set ko number line par o aur @ se dikhana (Topic 3), aur double inequation, \"aur\" (∩), \"ya\" (∪), khaali set (Topic 4). Ab sawaal ye hai ki **asli zindagi ki kahani se in auzaaron tak kaise pahunchein**, aur jawab ko kahani mein kaise parkhein. Is topic mein hum word problems hal karenge, ek \"kaun sa auzaar kab\" chart banayenge, kai topics ko jodne wale sawaal karenge, aakhri galtiyon se milenge, aur chapter ka saar ek table mein dekhenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 se Topic 4 tak tumhare paas inequation ke poore auzaar jama ho gaye: limit ki bhasha aur replacement set (Topic 1), hal karna aur negative se divide karte waqt sign ulatna (Topic 2), solution set ko number line par o aur @ se dikhana (Topic 3), aur double inequation, \"aur\" (∩), \"ya\" (∪), khaali set (Topic 4). Ab sawaal ye hai ki **asli zindagi ki kahani se in auzaaron tak kaise pahunchein**, aur jawab ko kahani mein kaise parkhein. Is topic mein hum word problems hal karenge, ek \"kaun sa auzaar kab\" chart banayenge, kai topics ko jodne wale sawaal karenge, aakhri galtiyon se milenge, aur chapter ka saar ek table mein dekhenge."
