            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Chaar-kadam tareeka** | Word problem ke chaar kadam: anjaan chuno, inequation likho, hal karo, story check karo | Figure 5.1 |\n| **Story check** | Hal ke baad jawab ko kahani mein rakhkar dekhna: kya wo replacement set mein hai (jaise ginti poori hai?) aur kahani ki shart poori karta hai? Topic 1 se hum ise chhote roop mein karte aaye hain (Topic 2 aur Topic 4 mein bhi), yahan iski poori aadat banti hai | Example 1 se Example 7 |\n| **Rounding ki disha** | Jab hadd decimal ho par jawab integer chahiye, to \"zyada se zyada\" mein neeche ka aur \"kam se kam\" mein upar ka integer chunna | Part A |\n| **Break-even point** | Wo value jahan do plans ka kharch barabar ho jaata hai. Iske ek taraf ek plan sasta hota hai, doosri taraf doosra | Example 4 |\n| **Method chooser** | Ek chart jisme har suraagh (kya diya hai, kya chahiye) ke saamne uska auzaar likha hai | Figure 5.6 |",
