            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Ratio (anupaat)** | Do cheezon ki tulna ye dekh kar ki ek, doosri ka **kitna guna ya kitna hissa** hai. a aur b ka ratio a : b likhte hain, aur ise fraction a/b ki tarah bhi padh sakte hain (b non-zero) | 1 glass syrup aur 4 glass paani ka ratio 1 : 4 |\n| **Pad (term)** | Ratio ka har ek number. a : b mein pehla pad a hai aur doosra pad b | 1 : 4 mein pad 1 aur 4 |\n| **Samaan jaati ki cheezein (like quantities)** | Wo cheezein jo ek hi tarah ki ho (lambai ke saath lambai, samay ke saath samay) aur **ek hi unit** mein naapi gayi ho. Ratio sirf aisi cheezon ka banta hai | 45 cm aur 200 cm (dono lambai, dono cm mein) |\n| **Sabse chhota roop (simplest form)** | Ratio ke dono pad ko unke HCF se divide karne par milne wala ratio, jisme dono pad ke beech 1 ke alawa koi common factor nahi bachta | 126 : 98 ka sabse chhota roop 9 : 7 |\n| **Barabar ratio (equivalent ratios)** | Aise ratios jinke fraction (fractions) barabar hon. Ek ratio ke dono pad ko ek hi non-zero number se guna ya bhaag karke milte hain | 1 : 4, 3 : 12 aur 5 : 20 |\n| **Proportion (samanupaat)** | Do barabar ratios ko jab hum barabar likhte hain: a : b :: c : d ka matlab a/b = c/d. Chaar numbers a, b, c, d isi kram mein \"proportion mein\" kahlate hain | 1 : 4 :: 3 : 12 |\n| **Extremes aur means** | Proportion a : b :: c : d mein **bahar ke do** pad (a aur d) extremes hain, aur **beech ke do** pad (b aur c) means hain | 4 : 9 :: 12 : 27 mein extremes 4 aur 27, means 9 aur 12 |\n| **Fourth proportional** | Teen numbers a, b, c diye hain to wo chautha number d, jo a : b :: c : d ko sach banaye | 7, 12, 21 ka fourth proportional 36 |",
