            "bodyHinglish": "Rupal ki class school-trip par ja rahi hai: school se pehle ek museum, aur phir museum se ek purana qila (fort). Teacher ma'am ne har bacche ko ek chhota map diya. Map par route ke do hisse (legs) hain: **school se museum 5 cm** aur **museum se fort 9 cm**. Ma'am ne bataya ki map par 1 cm asli sadak ke 7 km ke barabar hai.\n\nRupal ne dekha ki ticket par school se museum ka asli faasla 35 km likha hai. Usne jaldi se socha: doosra leg bhi 9 × 7 = 63 km hoga. Phir usne ye sach likha:\n\n**5 : 9 :: 35 : 63**, yaani 5/9 = 35/63.\n\n(Dono 5/9 hain: 35/63 mein 7 ka common factor hai, jo kat jaata hai.)\n\nTab ma'am ne ek paheli di: \"Maano map aadha bheeg gaya aur tumhe sirf ye pata hai ki dono legs ka **jod** 98 km hai aur map par legs ka ratio 5 : 9 hai. Kya tum 63 aur 35 ko seedha bina scale ke nikaal sakti ho? Aur agar sirf **antar** (difference) pata ho, tab?\"\n\nRupal ne apne sach proportion ko palat kar, jod kar aur ghata kar dekhna shuru kiya. Pata chala ki ek sach proportion se **paanch naye sach proportions** nikalte hain, aur har ek ka apna naam aur apna kaam hai. Chalo, ek-ek ko dekhte hain."
