            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Invertendo** | Proportion ke dono ratios ko ek saath ulta kar dena: a/b = c/d se b/a = d/c | 5/9 = 35/63 se 9/5 = 63/35 |\n| **Alternendo** | Beech ke do terms (b aur c) ki jagah badal dena: a/b = c/d se a/c = b/d | 5/9 = 35/63 se 5/35 = 9/63 |\n| **Componendo** | Dono ratios mein numerator mein denominator jod dena (yaani dono mein 1 jodna): a/b = c/d se (a + b)/b = (c + d)/d | 5/9 = 35/63 se 14/9 = 98/63 |\n| **Dividendo** | Dono ratios mein numerator se denominator ghata dena (yaani dono mein se 1 ghatana): a/b = c/d se (a − b)/b = (c − d)/d | 5/9 = 35/63 se (5 − 9)/9 = (35 − 63)/63 |\n| **Componendo-dividendo** | Componendo aur dividendo ke natije ko bhaag karke b hata dena: a/b = c/d se (a + b)/(a − b) = (c + d)/(c − d), jab a ≠ b ho | 5/9 = 35/63 se 14/(−4) = 98/(−28) |"
