            "bodyHinglish": "- **Topic 1** ([ratio-and-proportion.md](ratio-and-proportion.md)): a : b :: c : d ka matlab a/b = c/d hai, aur is par ad = bc (extremes ka guna = means ka guna). Hum yahan bhi har baar maan lete hain ki a, b, c, d koi bhi term 0 nahi hai.\n- Is topic mein **a, b, c, d hamesha isi kram mein** chaar terms hain, aur har proof ki shuruaat usi se hogi: **a/b = c/d.**"
