            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 mein tumne **chaar** numbers ki proportion a : b :: c : d dekhi aur product rule ad = bc seekha. Topic 2 mein us proportion ko ghuma-phirakar naye roop diye. Dono jagah har baar **do ratio** the, yaani chaar alag-alag numbers. Ab ek khaas halat: jab **dusre ratio ka pehla term wahi ho jo pehle ratio ka dusra term hai**. Tab chaar ki jagah sirf **teen** numbers bachte hain, aur beech wala number do kaam karta hai. Is topic mein is \"beech wale\" ka rishta, teen cheezon ko ek ratio mein jodna, aur chaar ki chain ki jhalak aayegi."
