            "body": "Atul ke Papa ki rang-roghan (paint) ki dukaan hai. Shanivaar ko ek aunty aayi aur boli, \"Beta, bilkul wahi narangi rang chahiye jo pichhli baar mere drawing-room ke liye banaya tha. Is baar poori chhat ke liye, zyada chahiye.\" Papa ke register mein likha tha: **laal : peela = 7 : 3.** Pichhli baar chhoti tin thi, is baar badi.\n\nAtul ne dekha ki aunty ke pehle order mein laal 21 L aur peela 9 L gaya tha, aur is baar laal 35 L chahiye. \"Peela kitna?\" Atul ne copy mein likha: **21 : 9 = 35 : ?** aur cross-multiply karne ki jagah usne ek alag soch aazmayi. \"Papa, har baar rang tab wahi aata hai jab hum **7 tin laal aur 3 tin peela** milayein, bas **ek tin ka size** badalta hai. Pichhli baar ek tin 3 L ka tha: 7 × 3 = 21, 3 × 3 = 9. Is baar tin ka size 5 L: 7 × 5 = 35, to peela 3 × 5 = 15 L.\"\n\nPapa ne muskura kar kaha, \"Ye 'ek tin ka size' hi to ratio ka raaz hai.\" Atul ke school ke puzzle club mein usne ye baat sunai, aur ek dost ne sawaal phenka: \"Agar a/b = c/d ho, to (a² + c²)/(b² + d²) = ac/(bd) kaise sach hota hai?\" Atul ne kaha: \"Dono ratio ke liye **ek hi tin ka size** maan lo, aur sab khud khul jaayega.\" Chalo dekhte hain kaise.",
