            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **k (ratio ka constant)** | Jab a/b = c/d ho, to dono ratio ki **ek hi common value**. Use k naam dete hain. Phir a = bk aur c = dk. | 8/12 = 14/21: dono 2/3, to k = 2/3 |\n| **k-method** | Proportion ko k ke zariye likhna: pehle k lo, a aur c ko b, d aur k mein badlo, phir simplify karo. | Part A se Part F |\n| **Identity** | Aisi baraabari jo kisi condition mein har sambhav values ke liye sach rehti hai (Class 9 mein (a + b)² = a² + 2ab + b² jaisi identity dekhi thi). Yahan condition hai a/b = c/d. | (a² + c²)/(b² + d²) = ac/(bd) jab a/b = c/d |\n| **Barabar ratio ka jod** | Agar kai ratio barabar hon, to unke numerators ka jod aur denominators ka jod bhi wahi ratio dete hain. | Part C |\n| **Common factor** | Wo cheez jo kisi sum ke **har term** mein guna hui ho (isliye use bahar nikalkar cancel kar sakte hain). | 4k + 6k mein k, 6b + 9b mein 3b |"
