            "body": "| Kahan | Kya mila | Is topic mein kahan kaam aayega |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Topic 1](ratio-and-proportion.md) | Proportion a : b :: c : d, yaani a/b = c/d, aur ad = bc | Part A: k-method aur ad = bc ek hi baat |\n| [Topic 2](ratio-and-proportion-part2.md) | Componendo-dividendo: (a + b)/(a − b) = (c + d)/(c − d) | Part B aur Part E |\n| [Topic 3](ratio-and-proportion-part3.md) | Continued proportion a : b = b : c aur b² = ac | Part F |\n| [GP, Topic 3](../geometric-progressions/geometric-progressions-part3.md) | Teen numbers GP mein hon to b² = ac | Part F |\n| [Quadratic equations, Topic 6](../quadratic-equations/quadratic-equations-part6.md) | Story check: jawab ko kahani ke saamne khada karo | Part C (word example) aur Part E (galat root) |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Kahan | Kya mila | Is topic mein kahan kaam aayega |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Topic 1](ratio-and-proportion.md) | Proportion a : b :: c : d, yaani a/b = c/d, aur ad = bc | Part A: k-method aur ad = bc ek hi baat |\n| [Topic 2](ratio-and-proportion-part2.md) | Componendo-dividendo: (a + b)/(a − b) = (c + d)/(c − d) | Part B aur Part E |\n| [Topic 3](ratio-and-proportion-part3.md) | Continued proportion a : b = b : c aur b² = ac | Part F |\n| [GP, Topic 3](../geometric-progressions/geometric-progressions-part3.md) | Teen numbers GP mein hon to b² = ac | Part F |\n| [Quadratic equations, Topic 6](../quadratic-equations/quadratic-equations-part6.md) | Story check: jawab ko kahani ke saamne khada karo | Part C (word example) aur Part E (galat root) |"
