            "question": "Say whether each pair is equal or not equal, with one reason. (a) [6 −1 8; 0 5 3] and [6 −1 8; 0 5 3]. (b) [6 −1 8; 0 5 3] and [6 −1; 8 0; 5 3]. (c) [4 9; 7 2] and [4 9; 2 7].",
