            "bodyHinglish": "School ke Annual Function ke liye bunting (jhandiyon ki mala) banani hai. Stage ke upar chhote pennants ki mala lagegi, aur main gate par bade pennants ki. Teacher ma'am ne Binita ko ek chhota paper pennant diya jiski sides 5 cm, 7 cm aur 8 cm hain, aur kaha: \"Printing wale uncle ne bade pennants kaat kar bheje hain. Dekh kar batao ki ye isi pennant ke bade bhai hain ya nahi. Garland tabhi achhi dikhegi jab har pennant ki **shape** ek hi ho.\"\n\nBinita ne socha: \"Teeno angle aur teeno sides naapu? Har pennant par chhe naap, aur pennants hain sau. Kya kam naapke kaam nahi chalega?\" Ma'am muskuraayi: \"Class 9 mein jab triangles ko **congruent** kehna tha, tab bhi saari chhe cheezein nahi naapi thi. Wahi soch yahan lagao: kitni kam cheezein shape ko pakka tay kar deti hain?\"\n\nChalo, wahi dhoondhte hain."
