            "headingHinglish": "Part A: Chaar kadam",
            "body": "Chaar kadam wahi aadat hain jo tumne Quadratic Equations, Linear Inequations, Ratio aur Matrices mein banayi thi. Bas yahan pehla kadam \"similar triangles dhoondho\" hai:\n\n```\n1. JODI DHOONDHO   : kaun se do triangle similar hain? A↔P, B↔Q, C↔R ka kram likho\n        :\n        v\n2. PROPORTION LIKHO: corresponding sides ka ratio (ek hi kram mein), ya area ke liye k × k\n        :\n        v\n3. HAL KARO        : cross-multiply (ad = bc), saari lambaiyan ek hi unit mein\n        :\n        v\n4. STORY CHECK     : jawab kahani mein sahi baithta hai? chhota-bada, unit, ulta ratio to nahi?\n```\n\n> **Figure 6.1** – Word problem ke chaar kadam. Zyada galtiyan pehle kadam (galat jodi) aur aakhri kadam (story check chhoot jaana) mein hoti hain.\n\n**Kyun?** Har sawaal mein asli sawaal ye hota hai ki \"kaun sa tool?\" Agar pehle kadam mein sahi do triangles aur unka sahi kram mil gaya, to baaki kaam sirf ek proportion hai. Aur agar sawaal area ka hai, to ratio ke saath k × k lagana hai (Topic 5): lambai k guna, area k × k guna.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Chaar kadam wahi aadat hain jo tumne Quadratic Equations, Linear Inequations, Ratio aur Matrices mein banayi thi. Bas yahan pehla kadam \"similar triangles dhoondho\" hai:\n\n```\n1. JODI DHOONDHO   : kaun se do triangle similar hain? A↔P, B↔Q, C↔R ka kram likho\n        :\n        v\n2. PROPORTION LIKHO: corresponding sides ka ratio (ek hi kram mein), ya area ke liye k × k\n        :\n        v\n3. HAL KARO        : cross-multiply (ad = bc), saari lambaiyan ek hi unit mein\n        :\n        v\n4. STORY CHECK     : jawab kahani mein sahi baithta hai? chhota-bada, unit, ulta ratio to nahi?\n```\n\n> **Figure 6.1** – Word problem ke chaar kadam. Zyada galtiyan pehle kadam (galat jodi) aur aakhri kadam (story check chhoot jaana) mein hoti hain.\n\n**Kyun?** Har sawaal mein asli sawaal ye hota hai ki \"kaun sa tool?\" Agar pehle kadam mein sahi do triangles aur unka sahi kram mil gaya, to baaki kaam sirf ek proportion hai. Aur agar sawaal area ka hai, to ratio ke saath k × k lagana hai (Topic 5): lambai k guna, area k × k guna."
